[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-shell-graduate-programme-2026-nigeria-opportunity-for-young-graduates-159":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},159,"shell-graduate-programme-2026-nigeria-opportunity-for-young-graduates-159","Shell Graduate Programme 2026 Nigeria: Opportunity For Young Graduates","\u003Cp>Applications are now being accepted from all qualified and interested Nigerian graduates for the Shell Graduate Programme 2026 Nigeria.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Shell Graduate Programme 2026 Nigeria Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Host: Shell Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: Lagos, Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Finternships\u002F\">Internships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Ftrainings\u002F\">Trainings\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Salary\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: Nigeria\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: \u003Cstrong>April 25, 2026\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Shell Graduate Programme 2026 Nigeria Details\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Shell Nigeria is looking for graduates who share our purpose to power progress and our culture of inclusion, collaboration, and care.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Shell Companies in Nigeria with its purpose to power progress, has had a long and lasting impact in Nigeria’s energy sector landscape. Shell is a global group of energy and petrochemicals companies with over 90,000 employees globally in more than 70 countries.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>As an graduate trainee at Shell, you will get the support you need to forge your path, and you’ll have real responsibilities and meaningful projects to work on right from the start.  \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Interested and qualified applicants should read the details provided on this page and submit their application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Shell Graduate Programme 2026 Nigeria Benefits\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Graduate Recruitment within Shell follows a standard global methodology used to attract, select, and place our best talent within the various Shell businesses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Selected applicants will receive;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hands-on Training\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Career Development\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Employment Opportunity\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How Much is the Shell Graduate Program Salary in Nigeria?\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Shell graduate trainee salary ranges between ₦4.8 and ₦8m annually. Other benefits include Life insurance, Health insurance, Severance pay, Paid leave and vacations, Sick leave.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Shell Graduate Trainee 2026 Nigeria Requirements\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Shell Graduate Trainee 2026 Nigeria, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold a Bachelor’s degree from a recognized university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Have completed or been exempted from the mandatory NYSC\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>As today’s changing world presents both opportunities and challenges, Shell need the brightest minds with passion to help solve them\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be interested and passionate about working in the oil and gas industry.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>Available Fields for Shell Nigeria Graduate Internship Programme 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>For the Shell Nigeria Graduate Internship Programme 2026, the company is seeking post-NYSC graduates for the following areas:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Engineering (Chemical, Mechanical, Civil, Electrical, Production)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Projects and Technology (Mechanical)\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Safety and Environment\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Commercial\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Shell Graduate Programme 2026 Nigeria\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Shell Graduate Programme 2026 Nigeria, follow the instructions we have outlined below; \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Read the details we have provided on this webpage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Click on the button below to visit the Shell career page.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proceed to click on the APPLY button.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Create an account, verify it, and log in.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Submit your application and upload all required documents.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fshell.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com\u002Fen-GB\u002FShellCareers\u002Fjob\u002FShell-Graduate-Programme-2026---Nigeria_R182181\">https:\u002F\u002Fshell.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com\u002Fen-GB\u002FShellCareers\u002Fjob\u002FShell-Graduate-Programme-2026---Nigeria_R182181\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-20 11:23:21",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplo